  (text "INPUT OVP (primary side)\nTrip = 2.495 V x (1 + 191k/10k) = 50.2 V rising\nHysteresis ~0.4 V (R84 2.2M)\nOVP_P high = over-voltage -> U12 VI1 -> VO1\n-> VIN_OVP -> PA15 (HRTIM1_FLT2 / EXTI15)"
    (at 124.46 152.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 9e1a62bd-75d4-4a2f-9de2-be18ca6c5cda)
  )
  (text "VIN MONITOR (primary side, monitoring only)\nRamp 0 -> 2.495 V in ~5 ms (Q9 ~24 uA into C82 47n C0G), reset ~20 us by U17/D7/C81/Q10\nU18: VINPWM_P high while RAMP > OVP_DIV  ->  U12 VI2 -> VO2 -> VIN_PWM -> PA2 (TIM15_CH1 PWM input)\nVIN = 50.36 V x (T_ramp - t_high) / T_ramp,  T_ramp = period - t_reset; calibrate once"
    (at 40.64 256.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 2ca5da9f-54df-417b-ab8f-c945b2bd7848)
  )

